  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Next Sentence Prediction** by following direct mathematical principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef nlp_next_sentence_prediction(cls_representation: list, W: list, b: list) -> dict:\n    logits = np.array(cls_representation, dtype=float) @ np.array(W, dtype=float) + np.array(b, dtype=float)\n    ex = np.exp(logits - np.max(logits))\n    p = ex / np.sum(ex)\n    return {'logits': np.round(logits, 4).tolist(), 'probabilities': np.round(p, 4).tolist(), 'is_next': bool(np.argmax(p) == 0)}\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the size of the primary input.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
